$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Method E. The appropriate
3-iodospirocyclopropaneindo-linone (1 equiv) was dissolved into 2:1
toluene/ethanol and 1 M aq Na2CO3 (2 equiv). The appropriate vinyl
boronic ester (1.2 equiv) and catalyst, Pd(PPh3)4 (5 mol %), were added,
and the resulting mixture was heated in a microwave for 2 h at 125 °C.
After cooling to rt, the mixture was diluted with H2O, extracted with
EtOAc (×2), and dried (MgSO4). After removal of solvents, the residue was
redissolved in MeOH and filtered through a Waters CX column and either
purified by prep-HPLC. The title compound as a TFA salt or by flash
chromatography followed by treatment with 1 M HCl in ether to generate
the HCl salt.
(1R,2S)-(E)-2-(3-(4-(Piperazin-1-yl)styryl)-1H-indazol-6-yl)spiro-[cyclopropane-1,3′-indolin]-2′-one
2,2,2-trifluoroacetate (37). The title compound was synthesized according
to the general method E using 17a (40 mg, 0.1 mmol) and (E)-tert-butyl
4-(4-(2-(4,4,5,5-
tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)vinyl)phenyl)piperazine-1-carboxylate
(50 mg, 0.12 mmol). The crude Boc-protected amine from the reaction was
dissolved into CH2Cl2 (10 mL), and TFA (1 mL) was added. The reaction was
stirred for 3 h, the solvent was removed and the residue purified by
prep-HPLC.
(1R,2S)-(E)-5′-Methyl-2-(3-(4-(morpholinomethyl)styryl)-1H-indazol-6-yl)spiro[cyclopropane-1,3′-indolin]-2′-one
2,2,2-trifluoroacetate (45). Prepared according to the general method E
using 32 (415 mg, 1 mmol) and
(E)-4-(4-(2-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-
2-yl)vinyl)benzyl)morpholine (329 mg, 1 mmol). Purification by prep-HPLC.
Title compound as a yellow solid (470 mg, 78%). HPLC: 99.5% at 270 nM. 1H
NMR (400 MHz, CD3OD) δ 7.73 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H), 7.53 (d, J = 8.0 Hz,
2H), 7.44 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 2H), 7.38 (s, 1H), 7.32 (d, J = 16.8 Hz, 1H),
7.27 (d, J = 16.8 Hz, 1H), 6.82 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H), 6.77 (d, J = 8.0 Hz,
1H), 6.73 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 1H), 5.78 (s, 1H), 4.29 (s, 2H), 3.99 (d, J =
11.2 Hz, 2H), 3.75 (t, J = 11.6 Hz, 2H), 3.42−3.32 (m, 2H), 3.21 (t, J =
8.4 Hz, 1H), 3.18−3.08 (m, 2H), 2.09−2.01 (m, 2H), 1.72 (s, 3H). HRMS
(ESI) m/z calcd for [C31H30N4O2 + H]+, 491.2447; found, 491.2445. Optical
rotation [α]23 D = −89° (c 0.28, MeOH).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation, Suzuki coupling, product purified by prep-HPLC and
isolated as TFA salt
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM The Discovery of Polo-Like Kinase 4 Inhibitors: Identification of
(1R,2S)-2-(3-((E)-4-(((cis)-2,6-Dimethylmorpholino)methyl)styryl)-1H-indazol-6-yl)-5'-methoxyspiro[cyclopropane-1,3'-indolin]-2'-one
(CFI-400945) as a Potent, Orally Active Antitumor Agent
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Sampson, Peter B.; Liu, Yong; Forrest, Bryan; Cumming, Graham; Li,
